                "VDF autoclave A-3 on Vinylid-Knap VK-4 already prints shell PT at 8.6 MPa, 2.6 "
                "over the 6.0 license, while initiator pump is still a lawful 4.2 L/h of a 5.5 L/h "
                "envelope. PT-first cuts VDF feed 18.0 t/h to 11.0; an initiator-first cruise would keep "
                "18.0 t/h. Agitator-seal brick stays mute on both publishers until AE later in the raster.",